  "instance_name": "antisemitic_stereotype_holocaust_metaphor",
  "label": "Holocaust Metaphor Stereotype",
  "description": "The phrase 'how do you like them well done please!' is a grotesque, antisemitic trope that dehumanizes Jewish victims of the Holocaust by comparing their murder to cooking or eating food. This metaphor is rooted in historical antisemitic propaganda and is used to trivialize and mock the genocide. It relies on real-world knowledge of the Holocaust and the specific historical context of Nazi atrocities against Jews.",
